  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [events](https://github.com/Gozala/events) from `v1.1.0` to `v1.1.1`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v1.1.1\n-   [`6bee6c0`](https://github.com/Gozala/events/commit/6bee6c0b23fc73bcc0b2b90d9245343b24dd6aad) travis: use container-based infrastructure\n-   [`47a55dd`](https://github.com/Gozala/events/commit/47a55dd43d823d1e079284b4557a9ae312e78909) Merge pull request #&#8203;22 from joseph-onsip/travis-container\n-   [`9fa409c`](https://github.com/Gozala/events/commit/9fa409c88670fbea76e318e9b5f0deec6874cc4d) update error message per NodeJs changes (#&#8203;30)\n-   [`a8a5107`](https://github.com/Gozala/events/commit/a8a5107cca14407a0c56dd29d87e660e1b3e7c20) update History.md\n-   [`623b6f5`](https://github.com/Gozala/events/commit/623b6f54f3cdccedd71b8b0f5e4b755bacdb5c62) v1.1.1\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
